# Static hosts that read _headers (Cloudflare Pages, Netlify).
# Blender's UI is a pthread build: it needs cross-origin isolation. Top-level
# visits get it from COOP + COEP; embedded in another origin's page (a
# playground), Document-Isolation-Policy isolates just this frame (Chromium).
/*
  Cross-Origin-Opener-Policy: same-origin
  Cross-Origin-Embedder-Policy: require-corp
  Document-Isolation-Policy: isolate-and-require-corp
  Cross-Origin-Resource-Policy: cross-origin
